{"message":"The Light Blue Account card ending in 6129 has been closed successfully for suspected fraud and is immediately deactivated. It cannot be reactivated.

The replacement order has not yet been placed because Entry-tier accounts require a 48-hour waiting period after closure. It will be eligible for standard delivery ordering on 11/16/2025. Standard delivery is free and takes 7–10 business days.

Please review your recent transactions, dispute any other unauthorized activity, change your online-banking password, and update any recurring payments linked to the closed card."}

